  "gaps": "Wall slabs are a flat ribbed block: no stepped zig-zag parapet frieze, no tall dark recesses between ribs, no entrance portal; dome is a little taller than the real flatter ellipsoid and the minaret shafts are thinner with plain cones instead of the flared white caps and fluted collars; boundary wall is crenellated rather than arcaded; surrounding trees are generic."
